  "totalBlocks": 88,
  "translatedBlocks": 84,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67cf664cf9a1acf4",
      "translationZh": "我们在 nanoVLM 仓库（一个使用纯 PyTorch 训练你自己的视觉语言模型的小型代码库）中从零实现了 KV 缓存。这让我们的生成速度提升了 38%。在这篇博文中，我们将介绍 KV 缓存，以及实现过程中的所有经验。我们从中获得的经验具有通用性，可应用于所有自回归语言模型的生成过程。在小型代码库中从零实现是一段绝佳的学习经历，一起来探索吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe0bd575005060aa",
      "translationZh": "自回归语言模型通过每次采样一个 token 来生成文本。在推理过程中，模型处理给定的输入序列，预测下一个 token，将其追加到序列中，然后重复这一过程，直到满足某个停止条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2331014f2c01cffb",
      "translationZh": "这种逐步生成的方式本质上是串行的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6e9a2f7d4ab369a",
      "translationZh": "要生成 token ti+1 t_{i+1} ti+1​，模型必须考虑从 t0 t_0 t0​ 到 ti t_i ti​ 的整个序列。在上面示例的第一个实例中，ti+1 t_{i+1} ti+1​ 就是 the，而之前从 t0 t_0 t0​ 到 ti t_i ti​ 的所有 token 则是 [What, is, in]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98ca2df950018f3a",
      "translationZh": "尽管 Transformer 内部是并行的，但每次进行新的预测，都需要完整地前向通过所有 Transformer 层，这会带来随序列长度呈平方增长的内存开销和计算量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c15b495fc4a937e0",
      "translationZh": "这种重复也会导致冗余计算。在本文中，我们将探讨 KV 缓存，这是一种缓解上述低效问题的优化技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33baddfc4ca88e8b",
      "translationZh": "目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2a25839ae88e23f",
      "translationZh": "回顾 Transformer 架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "618a273f030eaff2",
      "translationZh": "冗余从何而来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "426fb74607f77fac",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存如何解决这一问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56d6ae7715b94b27",
      "translationZh": "nanoVLM 中的 KV 缓存：从理论到实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e415357d0ae8eb37",
      "translationZh": "总结：为什么 KV 缓存很重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c2a25839ae88e23f",
      "translationZh": "回顾 Transformer 架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7001fdec7488080",
      "translationZh": "在深入探讨缓存之前，让我们先回顾一下注意力在 Transformer 模型中是如何运作的。Transformer 语言模型由多层堆叠而成，每一层都包含：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3439f9c55f37ca1",
      "translationZh": "多头自注意力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33ef54fe9d32cdb0",
      "translationZh": "前馈网络（MLP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c067d1b51621550d",
      "translationZh": "残差连接与层归一化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6c76ef37438bafe",
      "translationZh": "为了理解 KV Caching 在何处发挥作用，我们重点关注自注意力机制，具体来说，是单个注意力头内的计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75f50cf14574a019",
      "translationZh": "让我们逐步解析一个简单的 PyTorch 实现，直观展示其中的关键计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9996431828511d56",
      "translationZh": "自注意力计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "186a3dd7cbff8e28",
      "translationZh": "对于一个包含 T T T 个输入嵌入、表示为 X∈RT×D X \\in \\mathbb{R}^{T \\times D} X∈RT×D 的序列，自注意力的计算如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d68b52c747329d8a",
      "translationZh": "Q=XWQ Q = XW_Q Q=XWQ​，其中 WQ∈RD×Dq W_Q \\in \\mathbb{R}^{D \\times D_q} WQ​∈RD×Dq​",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5aa839c3249d2175",
      "translationZh": "K=XWK K = XW_K K=XWK​，其中 WK∈RD×Dk W_K \\in \\mathbb{R}^{D \\times D_k} WK​∈RD×Dk​",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f14a676906c5c7c",
      "translationZh": "V=XWV V = XW_V V=XWV​，其中 WV∈RD×Dv W_V \\in \\mathbb{R}^{D \\times D_v} WV​∈RD×Dv​",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "395c0dda04592615",
      "translationZh": "因果掩码 M M M，用于防止访问未来的 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74636d58f7ac0297",
      "translationZh": "最终输出为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a979680a23803d36",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个使用因果掩码的最简 PyTorch 等价实现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "618a273f030eaff2",
      "translationZh": "冗余从何而来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a933f7ba60b81e2",
      "translationZh": "在自回归生成中，模型每次生成一个 token。每一步，它都会重新计算整个序列的 Q Q Q、K K K 和 V V V，即使先前的 token 并未发生变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bbea47f54931ff3",
      "translationZh": "为了确认这种冗余：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb597ed095d180f3",
      "translationZh": "这些检查表明，除了最新的 token 之外，所有 token 的 K K K 和 V V V 都与先前计算出的值相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecb223440e1c0bdd",
      "translationZh": "■ = 已计算并复用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89c84051669f2f60",
      "translationZh": "□ = 不必要地重复计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12dfd3289ac1a0a2",
      "translationZh": "大部分注意力计算都在无谓地重复。随着序列变长，这种重复计算的成本会越来越高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "426fb74607f77fac",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存如何解决这一问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ee3ffb612fe40b0",
      "translationZh": "为了消除这种低效，我们使用 KV 缓存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2c23bc7d0d619db",
      "translationZh": "处理完初始提示词后，我们会缓存每一层计算出的键（ K K K ）和值（ V V V ）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b3aaddc85f20d12",
      "translationZh": "在生成过程中，我们只为新 token 计算 K K K 和 V V V，并将它们追加到缓存中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3dddf8219cd0bf14",
      "translationZh": "我们为当前 token 计算 Q Q Q，并将其与缓存的 K K K 和 V V V 一起用于得到输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a335d598f80ded36",
      "translationZh": "这使生成过程从对完整序列的重新计算，转变为轻量级的增量更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcd72d0db1cf4231",
      "translationZh": "✅ 在实践中，每一层的缓存都是一个字典，包含 \"key\" 和 \"value\" 两个键，其对应值的形状均为 (batch_size, num_heads, seq_len_cached, head_dim)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78d127d9f1e17de9",
      "translationZh": "这就是现代大语言模型能够高效生成长输出的基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "56d6ae7715b94b27",
      "translationZh": "nanoVLM 中的 KV 缓存：从理论到实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "068e589ab5966794",
      "translationZh": "既然我们已经理解了 KV 缓存背后的理论，接下来就看看它在我们的 nanoVLM 仓库中是如何实际实现的。这是一个理想的试验平台，因为它的代码库极为精简且自成一体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819ae55c1f35a526",
      "translationZh": "我们的模型在三个关键组件中启用了 KV 缓存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91555f7f9bac1b11",
      "translationZh": "使用并更新 KV 缓存的注意力模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a075579540623e75",
      "translationZh": "逐层跟踪缓存的语言模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8bf24a9c911bd6f",
      "translationZh": "将预填充阶段（使用输入提示词进行的首次前向计算）与顺序解码阶段分开的生成循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cc7c8498dfa7c7e4",
      "translationZh": "1. 在注意力模块中更新 KV 缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18834daf1abc446e",
      "translationZh": "在 LanguageModelGroupedAttention 类中，我们修改 forward 函数，使其能够接收并更新键和值的缓存（block_kv_cache）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "989f00ce47af312e",
      "translationZh": "此前，模型在每个生成步骤都会重新计算 K K K 和 V V V。现在，我们只计算当前词元的 Knew K_{\\text{new}} Knew​、Vnew V_{\\text{new}} Vnew​，并将它们追加到缓存值中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1b4521bc4105bf53",
      "translationZh": "2. 跨层跟踪缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b695faabbd50753",
      "translationZh": "在 LanguageModel 类中，我们引入了逐层缓存跟踪。start_pos 参数帮助模型为新生成的词元计算正确的旋转位置编码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "955c62ea8641b2af",
      "translationZh": "kv_cache：一个字典列表，每个 transformer 层对应一个字典，用于存储先前的键和值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1acd91e895d08e8",
      "translationZh": "start_pos：确保旋转位置嵌入与当前生成索引对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "003bfe00585d092f",
      "translationZh": "3. 生成循环中的预填充与解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60b12be8775f958f",
      "translationZh": "最大的架构变化发生在 VisionLanguageModel 的 generate() 方法中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6bde313e81944d0",
      "translationZh": "我们将生成过程分为两个阶段：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40661f15f5ea7e3e",
      "translationZh": "预填充阶段：对完整提示进行编码，并构建初始缓存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31e6de3576d2e00a",
      "translationZh": "解码阶段：使用缓存的键/值，每次生成一个词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "113a95f5439ed516",
      "translationZh": "以下是对应的代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b81b30d243fcc0d",
      "translationZh": "通过将这些阶段分离，我们避免了冗余计算，并大幅加快了推理速度，尤其是在处理长提示词时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fffa94ed873d2c61",
      "translationZh": "变更摘要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f148224ae44fb843",
      "translationZh": "模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea3acee2a8cd8b64",
